      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a strong start for the intro. For the body paragraphs, I want to really take down the \"meritocracy\" argument that people usually use to defend the status quo. Like, how can I frame the idea that people just \"don't work hard enough\" as being fundamentally logically flawed or even a myth used to keep certain groups down? I want to show that the whole idea of a level playing field is just a lie.",
